{{about|the skill type|the divination card|The Offering|the Labyrinth item|Offering to the Goddess}}

'''Offerings''' are [[skill]]s that consume [[corpse]]s to [[buff]] the player's [[minion]]s. Additional nearby corpses will also be consumed to extend the effect's [[duration]].

==Mechanics==
By default, each player may only have one Offering active at any time. Casting an Offering skill while one is already active will remove the older one.

Offering skill effects are separate objects that provide buffs to minions, and possibly the player with an effect like {{psl|Mistress of Sacrifice}}. While the object has a duration, the buffs do not; they cannot be affected by effect expiration modifiers such as {{il|Temporal Chains}} or {{il|Runegraft of the Warp}}.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3877525/page/3#p26572936</ref> 

Minions created after an Offering was activated are still affected by it, similar to new entities entering an existing aura.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QqGnwLU6_PU</ref>

Offerings can consume Spectral [[Corpse]]s due to their Minion [[gem tag]]; [[trigger]]ed Offerings may unintentionally consume [[corpse item]]s. 

